        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Francis Schaeffer\n- Organizations: Southwestern Baptist Theological Seminary\n- Concepts: Presuppositional apologetics, creation, the flood, scriptural authority, science and scripture\n- Documents: Statement on creation and the flood\n\nFacts:\n- Francis Schaeffer was a pastor.\n- Francis Schaeffer was known for taking a more presuppositional approach to apologetics.\n- Francis Schaeffer was one of the signatories of a statement followed by Southwestern Baptist Theological Seminary.\n- The statement followed by Southwestern Baptist Theological Seminary says that science cannot override scriptural statements on creation and the flood.",
